{"seq":4,"slug":"interface-module-pattern","title":"接口模块模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-architecture/modular-design/interface-module-pattern","wordCount":782,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"接口模块模式\">接口模块模式</h1><p>接口模块模式（Interface Module Pattern）是大型 iOS 模块化项目中解耦模块间依赖的核心手段。通过将协议定义与具体实现分离到不同模块，实现模块级别的依赖反转。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>接口模块模式把「协议」与「实现」拆到不同模块，从而在模块层面实现依赖反转：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>协议模块（Protocol-Only Module）</strong>：只包含协议定义，不包含实现，被多方共用</li>\n<li><strong>实现模块（Implementation Module）</strong>：提供协议的具体实现，依赖协议模块</li>\n<li><strong>消费模块</strong>：只依赖协议模块即可调用能力，无需引入实现</li>\n<li><strong>模块级依赖反转</strong>：依赖方向指向抽象（协议），而非具体实现</li>\n</ul>\n<p>关键收益是<strong>编译隔离</strong>：消费方只编译协议即可通过，具体实现的改动不会触发消费方重新编译。这也让同一协议可以有多个实现（如真实实现与 Mock）自由替换。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"问题背景\">问题背景</h2><p>当模块 A 需要使用模块 B 的功能时，直接依赖会导致紧耦合：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[&quot;FeatureHome&quot;] --&gt;|直接依赖| B[&quot;FeatureProfile&quot;]&#10;&#10;    classDef mod fill:none,stroke:#F44336&#10;    class A,B mod\">graph LR\n    A[\"FeatureHome\"] --&gt;|直接依赖| B[\"FeatureProfile\"]\n\n    classDef mod fill:none,stroke:#F44336\n    class A,B mod</pre><p>这种直接依赖带来的问题：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>编译耦合</td>\n<td>修改 B 会触发 A 重新编译</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>测试困难</td>\n<td>测试 A 需要引入整个 B</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>循环风险</td>\n<td>B 未来可能也需要 A 的功能</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并行构建受限</td>\n<td>A 和 B 无法并行编译</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"接口模块解决方案\">接口模块解决方案</h2><p>将协议抽取到独立的接口模块中：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;FeatureHome&quot;] --&gt; BI[&quot;FeatureProfileInterface&quot;]&#10;    B[&quot;FeatureProfile&quot;] --&gt; BI&#10;    B -.-&gt;|实现| BI&#10;    App[&quot;App 壳工程&quot;] --&gt; A&#10;    App --&gt; B&#10;&#10;    classDef feat fill:none,stroke:#2196F3&#10;    classDef iface fill:none,stroke:#4CAF50&#10;    classDef app fill:none,stroke:#FF9800&#10;&#10;    class A,B feat&#10;    class BI iface&#10;    class App app\">graph TD\n    A[\"FeatureHome\"] --&gt; BI[\"FeatureProfileInterface\"]\n    B[\"FeatureProfile\"] --&gt; BI\n    B -.-&gt;|实现| BI\n    App[\"App 壳工程\"] --&gt; A\n    App --&gt; B\n\n    classDef feat fill:none,stroke:#2196F3\n    classDef iface fill:none,stroke:#4CAF50\n    classDef app fill:none,stroke:#FF9800\n\n    class A,B feat\n    class BI iface\n    class App app</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"协议模块-protocol-only-module\">协议模块（Protocol-Only Module）</h2><p>接口模块只包含协议定义和值类型，不包含任何实现代码：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"// FeatureProfileInterface 模块&#10;public struct UserProfile: Sendable {&#10;    public let id: String&#10;    public let displayName: String&#10;    public let avatarURL: URL?&#10;    public let bio: String&#10;&#10;    public init(id: String, displayName: String, avatarURL: URL?, bio: String) {&#10;        self.id = id&#10;        self.displayName = displayName&#10;        self.avatarURL = avatarURL&#10;        self.bio = bio&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;public protocol ProfileServiceProtocol: Sendable {&#10;    func fetchProfile(userId: String) async throws -&gt; UserProfile&#10;    func updateProfile(_ profile: UserProfile) async throws&#10;}&#10;&#10;public protocol ProfileNavigatorProtocol: AnyObject {&#10;    func showProfile(userId: String)&#10;    func showEditProfile()&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// FeatureProfileInterface 模块</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> UserProfile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Sendable </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> displayName: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> avatarURL: URL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bio: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> init</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">displayName</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">avatarURL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: URL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">bio</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.displayName </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> displayName</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.avatarURL </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> avatarURL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.bio </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bio</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> protocol</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ProfileServiceProtocol</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Sendable </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetchProfile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">userId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> throws</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> UserProfile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> updateProfile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> profile: UserProfile) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> throws</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> protocol</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ProfileNavigatorProtocol</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">AnyObject</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> showProfile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">userId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> showEditProfile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"实现模块-implementation-module\">实现模块（Implementation Module）</h2><p>实现模块依赖接口模块并提供具体实现：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"// FeatureProfile 模块（依赖 FeatureProfileInterface）&#10;import FeatureProfileInterface&#10;import CoreNetworking&#10;&#10;final class ProfileService: ProfileServiceProtocol {&#10;    private let httpClient: HTTPClientProtocol&#10;&#10;    init(httpClient: HTTPClientProtocol) {&#10;        self.httpClient = httpClient&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    func fetchProfile(userId: String) async throws -&gt; UserProfile {&#10;        let dto: ProfileDTO = try await httpClient.get(&quot;/users/\\(userId)/profile&quot;)&#10;        return UserProfile(&#10;            id: dto.id,&#10;            displayName: dto.name,&#10;            avatarURL: URL(string: dto.avatar),&#10;            bio: dto.bio&#10;        )&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    func updateProfile(_ profile: UserProfile) async throws {&#10;        try await httpClient.put(&quot;/users/\\(profile.id)/profile&quot;, body: ProfileDTO(from: profile))&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// FeatureProfile 模块（依赖 FeatureProfileInterface）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FeatureProfileInterface</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CoreNetworking</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">final</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ProfileService</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ProfileServiceProtocol </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> httpClient: HTTPClientProtocol</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    init</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">httpClient</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: HTTPClientProtocol) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.httpClient </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> httpClient</sp