an style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"FeatureProfileInterface\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">targets</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"FeatureProfileInterface\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    dependencies</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">package</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"../CoreNetworking\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    targets</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">target</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"FeatureProfileInterface\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dependencies</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: []),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">target</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"FeatureProfile\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            dependencies</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"FeatureProfileInterface\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CoreNetworking\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">testTarget</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"FeatureProfileTests\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dependencies</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"FeatureProfile\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"模块级依赖反转\">模块级依赖反转</h2><p>接口模块模式本质上是依赖反转原则（DIP）在模块级别的应用：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph Before[&quot;改造前&quot;]&#10;        BA[&quot;FeatureHome&quot;] --&gt;|依赖| BB[&quot;FeatureProfile&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph After[&quot;改造后&quot;]&#10;        AA[&quot;FeatureHome&quot;] --&gt;|依赖| AI[&quot;FeatureProfileInterface&quot;]&#10;        AB[&quot;FeatureProfile&quot;] --&gt;|实现| AI&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    classDef feat fill:none,stroke:#2196F3&#10;    classDef iface fill:none,stroke:#4CAF50&#10;&#10;    class BA,BB,AA,AB feat&#10;    class AI iface\">graph TB\n    subgraph Before[\"改造前\"]\n        BA[\"FeatureHome\"] --&gt;|依赖| BB[\"FeatureProfile\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph After[\"改造后\"]\n        AA[\"FeatureHome\"] --&gt;|依赖| AI[\"FeatureProfileInterface\"]\n        AB[\"FeatureProfile\"] --&gt;|实现| AI\n    end\n\n    classDef feat fill:none,stroke:#2196F3\n    classDef iface fill:none,stroke:#4CAF50\n\n    class BA,BB,AA,AB feat\n    class AI iface</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>直接依赖</th>\n<th>接口模块模式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>编译影响</td>\n<td>实现变更触发重编译</td>\n<td>只有接口变更触发重编译</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并行编译</td>\n<td>受限</td>\n<td>接口模块稳定后可充分并行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>测试隔离</td>\n<td>需引入完整实现模块</td>\n<td>只需依赖接口模块 + Mock</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代码量</td>\n<td>少</td>\n<td>多（需维护接口模块）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 不是所有模块都需要接口模块。对于 Shared 和 Core 层的稳定模块，直接依赖即可。接口模块主要用于 Feature 层之间的解耦。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>接口模块模式将协议定义与具体实现分离到不同的 SPM 包或 Target</li>\n<li>协议模块只包含 protocol 和值类型，零实现依赖，编译速度极快</li>\n<li>消费模块只依赖接口模块，通过依赖注入在运行时获取具体实现</li>\n<li>这种模式本质上是依赖反转原则在模块级别的应用</li>\n<li>推荐使用单包多 Target 结构来减少包的数量</li>\n<li>接口模块适用于 Feature 间的解耦，Core/Shared 层通常不需要</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"接口模块模式","id":"接口模块模式"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"问题背景","id":"问题背景"},{"level":2,"text":"接口模块解决方案","id":"接口模块解决方案"},{"level":2,"text":"协议模块（Protocol-Only Module）","id":"协议模块-protocol-only-module"},{"level":2,"text":"实现模块（Implementation Module）","id":"实现模块-implementation-module"},{"level":2,"text":"消费模块的使用方式","id":"消费模块的使用方式"},{"level":2,"text":"Package.swift 配置","id":"package-swift-配置"},{"level":2,"text":"模块级依赖反转","id":"模块级依赖反转"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"二进制框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-architecture/modular-design/binary-frameworks"},"next":{"title":"依赖注入基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-architecture/dependency-injection/di-fundamentals"}}